Piano Transcription GUI
Copyright 2026 yu1row

This product includes software developed for local piano audio-to-MIDI
transcription using upstream research and inference code.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Upstream piano transcription (Apache License 2.0)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
This project uses the pretrained inference stack from:

  - https://github.com/bytedance/piano_transcription
  - https://github.com/qiuqiangkong/piano_transcription_inference

License: Apache License 2.0

Paper:
  Qiuqiang Kong, Bochen Li, Xuchen Song, Yuan Wan, and Yuxuan Wang.
  "High-resolution Piano Transcription with Pedals by Regressing Onsets
  and Offsets Times." arXiv:2010.01815 (2020).

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Pretrained model checkpoint
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
The default checkpoint is downloaded at runtime from Zenodo record 4034264
(CRNN note/pedal model used by piano_transcription_inference). Use of the
checkpoint is subject to the upstream project / Zenodo distribution terms.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Optional bundled ffmpeg (Windows binary releases only)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Release builds may ship ffmpeg.exe obtained from:
  https://www.gyan.dev/ffmpeg/builds/ (essentials build)

ffmpeg is a separate executable (not linked into the Python app) and is
licensed under LGPL/GPL depending on build configuration.
